      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nb or Ti is to be added to the starting Mg-containing alloy.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nb or Ti addition will stabilize a solid-solution phase in the Mg-containing alloy.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "node::10.1016/j.mtcomm.2024.109314"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nb or Ti addition will suppress the formation of brittle intermetallic compounds.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refractory-element addition will alter alloy phase stability.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "node::10.1016/j.mtcomm.2024.109314"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed phase stabilization and intermetallic suppression will increase strength relative to the alloy without the refractory-element addition.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "node::10.1038/nature17981",
        "node::10.3390/ma15175815"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed phase stabilization and intermetallic suppression will increase ductility relative to the alloy without the refractory-element addition.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "node::10.1038/nature17981"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refractory-element addition will improve corrosion resistance relative to the alloy without the addition.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "node::10.1016/j.mtcomm.2024.109314"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refractory-element addition will improve high-temperature oxidation resistance relative to the alloy without the addition.",
